  "Id": 2904,
  "Title": "Abd al-Aziz al-Babtain and the Formation of Modern Kuwait by Professor Leif Stenberg",
  "NewsSubTitle": "AKU-ISMC Publications",
  "NewsSummary": "Pofessor Leif Stenberg discusses his new book.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass78F1A28BCD334229B02F2E594A7B51BE\"><p>\u200b\u200b\u200b</p><p>Pofessor&#160;Leif Stenberg discusses his new book on the history of the Kuwait as seen through the life, career and philanthropy of the successful businessman and poet, Abd al-Aziz al-Babtain.\u200b Find out more about <a href=\"/ismc/publications/Pages/iv.aspx\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Poet and Businessman&#58; Abd al-Aziz al-Babtain and the Formation of Modern Kuwait</em></a><em>.\u200b</em><br></p><p>\r\n   <a href=\"/ismc/people/Pages/leif-stenberg.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">Leif Stenberg \u200b</a>is Dean and Professor of Islamic Studies at the Aga Khan University's&#160;Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC)\u200b. Between 2010 and 2019 Stenberg was President of the Nordic Society of Middle Eastern Studies and he is currently a member of the World Congress of Middle Eastern Studies (WOCMES) Council and vice-president of the European Association for Middle Eastern Studies (EURAMES).\u200b<br><br></p>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https&#58;//www.youtube.com/embed/WV1Ho8fGmMY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><br></div>",
